"Build the Multi-Cloud Agentic SRE system described in docs/plan.md. Run Inception for Phases 1 to 3 only: requirements, non-functional requirements (safety, cost, latency), risks and units of work. Phrase acceptance criteria in EARS and give each an ID (REQ-001). Treat docs/plan.md as input to question, not as settled requirements. Include safety requirements that the coding agent cannot change its own guardrails, tool configuration or CI gates (.mcp.json, .claude/settings.json, .github/, tools/claude-hooks/, tools/ci/), that the guardrails cover MCP tool calls as well as shell commands, and that the coding agent uses read-only cloud credentials by default."
